    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small breaks dont really change the math though. the numbers never actually go down, they just stay the same or get worse. it's like i'm staring at a math equation that has no solution. no matter how hard i run, i'm still just stuck in the same spot, just more tired. it feels less like a struggle and more like a trap that's already closed.",
